('bb2514f7-4390-6438-30d6-c5b718a46981',1,'Go! Go! Cory Carson: Chrissy Takes the Wheel','G','Movie','From arcade games to sled days and hiccup cures, Cory Carson’s curious little sister Chrissy speeds off on her own for fun and adventure all over town!'),
('dc2e6daf-7a8b-44c1-2a1c-aa98eed6fe25',2,'Jeans','PG-13','Movie','When the father of the man she loves insists that his twin sons marry twin sisters, a woman creates an alter ego that might be a bit too convincing.'),
