('d61cedb3-79ed-44c6-94cc-98077940a3b4',3,'Ankahi Kahaniya','PG-13','Movie','As big city life buzzes around them, lonely souls discover surprising sources of connection and companionship in three tales of love, loss and longing.'),
('00fe08f6-1077-fde0-af95-05b0c3167a23',0,'The Father Who Moves Mountains','R','Movie','When his son goes missing during a snowy hike in the mountains, a retired intelligence officer will stop at nothing — and risk everything — to find him.'),
