('31085c64-fcde-33b1-643e-b4c5080eda31',0,'What Is Love?','PG-13','Series','A 32-year-old romantic looking for a long-term, monogamous relationship meets a handsome bad boy who only believes in one-night stands.'),
('7f0c90e9-3305-941f-c2ed-48cf2350618b',1,'When Calls the Heart','PG','Series','Leaving behind her upper-crust city roots, a woman journeys west in the early 1900s to become a teacher in a small Canadian mining community.'),
('f396fa63-d1a4-665a-8727-bab0ee7565dd',2,'Who\'s the One','PG-13','Series','A doctor performs plastic surgery on a fat man who\'s been jilted, and continues his transformation by turning him into a handsome, desirable man.'),
('447d1f6e-5e69-b518-81c7-54ba07057b8a',3,'Wild Alaska','PG','Series','The natural bounty of Alaska sustains its diverse species through extreme weather conditions in three seasons, each with its rewards and challenges.'),
('3680a072-3c30-6ee8-58fe-3821119ff9e0',0,'Wild Arabia','PG','Series','The widely varied geology and dramatic landscapes in the continental crossroads of Arabia harbors a rich history and an abundance of wildlife.'),
('7f9a0a13-1610-023c-1a53-0d226c365220',1,'Winsanity','G','Series','Actor Donald Faison hosts this game show in which contestants must arrange numerical-based trivia tidbits from largest to smallest for various prizes.'),
('0c7ad347-74f0-3cee-49d6-ff43fefe311a',2,'Winter Sun','R','Series','Years after ruthless businessmen kill his father and order the death of his twin brother, a modest fisherman adopts a new persona to exact revenge.'),
('6539de0f-519b-f334-dcf7-1ce4bd8dcf7c',3,'Women Behind Bars','PG-13','Series','This reality series recounts true stories of women who have been convicted for murder, including an in-depth examination of each crime.'),
('e78bc68a-2fe5-df4a-31b7-c61ac9f22ae9',0,'World\'s Busiest Cities','PG','Series','From Moscow to Mexico City, three BBC journalists delve into the inner workings of some of the most burgeoning metropolises on Earth.'),
('79f58264-b125-4f0e-d6cc-4313ba9a1902',1,'Yeh Meri Family','PG','Series','In the summer of 1998, middle child Harshu balances school, family, friendship and other challenges of growing up.'),
('48239e7d-67ab-5530-7cac-13633f8531b6',2,'Yo-Kai Watch','G','Series','Nate frees a mythical being trapped in a magic capsule, and the two new friends have adventures with all sorts of troublesome supernatural creatures.'),
('708db342-0cdd-b152-8b71-412ab5c4f948',3,'Yoko','G','Series','Friends Mai, Oto and Vik\'s games at the park become magical adventures, thanks to Yoko, who can turn playgrounds into spaceships and camping sites.'),
('13a4dff0-2b95-c494-110f-7998bba848f3',0,'YOM','G','Series','With the mind of a human being, and the body of whichever animal he chooses to be, a young boy protects the world from danger.'),
('63985ac1-5aa0-b35d-4b6e-c25f41fff13b',1,'Yu-Gi-Oh! Arc-V','G','Series','Now that he\'s discovered the Pendulum Summoning technique, Yuya\'s dream of becoming the greatest "dueltainer" is in reach – but it won\'t be easy!'),
('f01043eb-6966-f712-f578-9f44267671f0',2,'Yunus Emre','PG','Series','During the Mongol invasions, Yunus Emre leaves his home to travel across the Ottoman Empire, defying hardships and temptations to become a dervish.'),
('69f1b7eb-bfc8-80a3-9c90-ecd72ed66e6f',3,'Zak Storm','G','Series','Teen surfer Zak Storm is mysteriously transported to the Bermuda Triangle, where he becomes the captain of a magical ship full of misfits.'),
('bbb39a53-e6fb-ca4e-f7e3-b4069329cdf6',0,'Zindagi Gulzar Hai','PG','Series','Strong-willed, middle-class Kashaf and carefree, wealthy Zaroon meet in college, but before love can take root, they each have some growing up to do.'),
('43d955b8-8720-9be6-39dd-b07e2c6002e3',1,'Zombie Dumb','G','Series','While living alone in a spooky town, a young girl befriends a motley crew of zombie children with diverse personalities.');
